Thought: Test a robust median combination over pool2 to see if a different robust strategy beats ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full pool using inverse-error weighting to see if leveraging all models improves over best_single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ARIMA","ETS","THETA","rf","ONLY_FT_catboost","ONLY_FT_rf"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust weighted combination on pool4 using inverse_error weighting to see if it beats the best_single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool4","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean on pool4 to see if trimming outliers improves over weighted inverse‑error.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a deterministic barycenter on pool4 to see if it outperforms the weighted inverse-error baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool4","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool4 using the w=w1 weighting scheme to see if a different weighting improves over the current best DBA.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool4","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a deterministic barycenter on pool3 to see if a smaller, more diverse pool improves over the current best dba on pool4.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on pool4 to see if it can beat the current dba pool4 leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test an inverse‑error weighted combination on pool5 to see if a different pool improves over the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool5","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if averaging the strong models outperforms dba on the same pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

